{"unit_id":"PengboNB__skk-gal-dsh#feature-1","repo":"PengboNB/skk-gal-dsh","commit":"f59673eb89f77a000586b677a4342afe4b827b4d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"skk-gal 的功能「剧场视图与主题」：丝柯克剧场在会话页作为独立视图注册，并为新对话页与侧栏应用主题背景；在设置中可关闭全局主题。用户从会话标签切换进入剧场。","source":"generated","evidence":[".dsh-plugin/client/index.mjs:313",".dsh-plugin/client/index.mjs:342"]}
{"unit_id":"PengboNB__skk-gal-dsh#feature-2","repo":"PengboNB/skk-gal-dsh","commit":"f59673eb89f77a000586b677a4342afe4b827b4d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"skk-gal 的功能「逐段回复和工作流」：剧场将会话内容整理为角色回复卡片，并提供显示全文的交互以查看对应回复的工作流细节；最新回复支持逐字显示或即时显示。","source":"generated","evidence":[".dsh-plugin/client/SkirkGal.jsx:309",".dsh-plugin/client/SkirkGal.jsx:345"]}
{"unit_id":"PengboNB__skk-gal-dsh#feature-3","repo":"PengboNB/skk-gal-dsh","commit":"f59673eb89f77a000586b677a4342afe4b827b4d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"skk-gal 的功能「待处理任务」：剧场内列出等待回应的授权或选项，可提交允许、拒绝或选择结果；也可打开 DSH 原生任务面板。","source":"generated","evidence":[".dsh-plugin/client/SkirkGal.jsx:136",".dsh-plugin/client/SkirkGal.jsx:165"]}
{"unit_id":"PengboNB__skk-gal-dsh#feature-4","repo":"PengboNB/skk-gal-dsh","commit":"f59673eb89f77a000586b677a4342afe4b827b4d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"skk-gal 的功能「会话回收站」：设置页可管理已归档会话并将删除请求加入队列；DSH 退出后工作进程把会话移入本地回收站，提供恢复流程。","source":"generated","evidence":[".dsh-plugin/client/SkirkQuickSettings.jsx:14",".dsh-plugin/session-trash-worker.mjs:44",".dsh-plugin/session-trash-worker.mjs:84"]}
